</li><li> Tap on <span class="button">Next</span>
</li><li> Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "31940", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 19, 2012, 6:18:00 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-19T06:18:00-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "username is \"email address\" !", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 19, 2012, 6:18:26 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-19T06:18:26-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:49+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (31996,'en-US','add-email-accounts','Add email accounts','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/add-email-accounts','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/add-email-accounts/revision/31996',31940,'2012-09-20T08:32:00-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','add icons and move notes to the bottom',1,'2012-09-20T08:32:14-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
# If this is the first time you have run the email app, it will present you with the new account wizard with a selection of email providers. If this is not the first time, tap [[Image:menu icon]] and then tap [[Image:setting]] and then tap {button Add Account}
# Tap on the email provider for your account
# Enter your email address and password
# Tap on {button Next}
# Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!

== Notes ==
{note}
# Your phone must be connected to the internet via WiFi or 3G in order to create your account.
# The email app doesn''t allow you to create a new email account. It only allows you to add an existing email account. If you need a new email account, please create a new account at your email provider''s website before adding it to the email app.
# Only certain email providers are supported. Please see the [[Firefox OS FAQ]] for the official list of supported email providers.
{/note}','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> If this is the first time you have run the email app, it will present you with the new account wizard with a selection of email providers. If this is not the first time, tap <img alt="menu icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-10-57-3ce679.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and then tap <img alt="setting" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-15-58-56-799b1c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and then tap <span class="button">Add Account</span>
</li><li> Tap on the email provider for your account
</li><li> Enter your email address and password
</li><li> Tap on <span class="button">Next</span>
</li><li> Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!
</li></ol>
<h2 id="w_notes">Notes</h2>
<div class="note">
<ol><li> Your phone must be connected to the internet via WiFi or 3G in order to create your account.
</li><li> The email app doesn''t allow you to create a new email account. It only allows you to add an existing email account. If you need a new email account, please create a new account at your email provider''s website before adding it to the email app.
</li><li> Only certain email providers are supported. Please see the <a href="/en-US/kb/firefox-os-faq">Firefox OS FAQ</a> for the official list of supported email providers.
</li></ol>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "31996", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 20, 2012, 8:32:00 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-20T08:32:00-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "add icons and move notes to the bottom", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 20, 2012, 8:32:14 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-20T08:32:14-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:46+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32228,'en-US','firefox-os-faq','Firefox OS FAQ','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/firefox-os-faq','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/firefox-os-faq/revision/32228',NULL,'2012-09-24T07:40:48-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!',1,'2012-09-24T07:41:16-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','This article gives answers to frequently asked questions about Firefox OS

__TOC__ 

= Email =
== What email providers are supported? ==
Hotmail and Yahoo mail are currently supported with more on the way in future releases.
== Are there any other limitations? ==
Currently Firefox OS doesn''t support copy/paste, sending HTML email and attachments. These features are being considered for future releases.
== What do I do if my email provider isn''t supported? ==
Please let us know via support.mozilla.org. In the meantime, you can the web browser on Firefox OS.','<p>This article gives answers to frequently asked questions about Firefox OS
</p>
<div id="toc"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><ul><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_email"><span class="tocnumber">1</span> <span class="toctext">Email</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_what-email-providers-are-supported"><span class="tocnumber">1.1</span> <span class="toctext">What email providers are supported?</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_are-there-any-other-limitations"><span class="tocnumber">1.2</span> <span class="toctext">Are there any other limitations?</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_what-do-i-do-if-my-email-provider-isnt-supported"><span class="tocnumber">1.3</span> <span class="toctext">What do I do if my email provider isn''t supported?</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></div> 
<h1 id="w_email">Email</h1>
<h2 id="w_what-email-providers-are-supported">What email providers are supported?</h2>
<p>Hotmail and Yahoo mail are currently supported with more on the way in future releases.
</p>
<h2 id="w_are-there-any-other-limitations">Are there any other limitations?</h2>
<p>Currently Firefox OS doesn''t support copy/paste, sending HTML email and attachments. These features are being considered for future releases.
</p>
<h2 id="w_what-do-i-do-if-my-email-provider-isnt-supported">What do I do if my email provider isn''t supported?</h2>
<p>Please let us know via <a href="http://support.mozilla.org">support.mozilla.org</a>. In the meantime, you can the web browser on Firefox OS.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32228", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 7:40:48 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T07:40:48-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 7:41:16 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T07:41:16-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:44+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32231,'en-US','add-email-accounts','Add email accounts','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/add-email-accounts','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/add-email-accounts/revision/32231',31996,'2012-09-24T07:54:53-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','fix very minor typos in order to un-break link to firefox os faq',1,'2012-09-24T07:55:17-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
# If this is the first time you have run the email app, it will present you with the new account wizard with a selection of email providers. If this is not the first time, tap [[Image:menu icon]] and then tap [[Image:setting]] and then tap {button Add Account}
# Tap on the email provider for your account.
# Enter your email address and password.
# Tap on {button Next}
# Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!

