# Only certain email providers are supported. Please see the [[Firefox OS FAQ]] for the official list of supported email providers.
{/note}','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
