</li><li> Tap on the email provider for your account.
</li><li> Enter your email address and password.
</li><li> Tap on <span class="button">Next</span>
</li><li> Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!
</li></ol>
<h2 id="w_notes">Notes</h2>
<div class="note">
<ol><li> Your phone must be connected to the internet via WiFi or 3G in order to create your account.
</li><li> The email app doesn''t allow you to create a new email account. It only allows you to add an existing email account. If you need a new email account, please create a new account at your email provider''s website before adding it to the email app.
</li><li> Only certain email providers are supported. Please see the <a href="/en-US/kb/firefox-os-faq">Firefox OS FAQ</a> for the official list of supported email providers.
</li></ol>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32231", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 7:54:53 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T07:54:53-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "fix very minor typos in order to un-break link to firefox os faq", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 7:55:17 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T07:55:17-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:42+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32234,'en-US','send-and-manage-email','Send and manage email','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/send-and-manage-email','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/send-and-manage-email/revision/32234',NULL,'2012-09-24T08:36:35-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!',1,'2012-09-24T08:37:01-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# In the email app, tap [[Image:add icon]]
# Enter recipients in the "To" and/or "cc/bcc" field:
#* Either tap [[Image:add icon]] to access all of your contacts OR
#* Enter a full email address or part of an email address or name and tap [[Image:add icon]] and auto-complete will offer matching contacts if any to eliminate needless typing.
# Enter your email Subject and text.
# Tap {button Send}','<ol><li> In the email app, tap <img alt="add icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-08-57-8cef3c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Enter recipients in the "To" and/or "cc/bcc" field:
<ul><li> Either tap <img alt="add icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-08-57-8cef3c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to access all of your contacts OR
</li><li> Enter a full email address or part of an email address or name and tap <img alt="add icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-08-57-8cef3c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and auto-complete will offer matching contacts if any to eliminate needless typing.
</li></ul>
</li><li> Enter your email Subject and text.
</li><li> Tap <span class="button">Send</span>
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32234", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 8:36:35 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T08:36:35-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 8:37:01 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T08:37:01-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:39+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32236,'en-US','send-and-manage-email','Send and manage email','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/send-and-manage-email','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/send-and-manage-email/revision/32236',32234,'2012-09-24T08:51:11-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','put field names in italic, add a step about opening the email app',1,'2012-09-24T08:51:34-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
#  Tap [[Image:add icon]]
# Enter recipients in the ''''To ''''and/or ''''cc/bcc'''' field:
#* Either tap [[Image:add icon]] to access all of your contacts OR
#* Enter a full email address or part of an email address or name and tap [[Image:add icon]] and auto-complete will offer matching contacts if any to eliminate needless typing.
# Enter your email ''''Subject'''' and text in the fields below
# Tap {button Send}','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li>  Tap <img alt="add icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-08-57-8cef3c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Enter recipients in the <em>To </em>and/or <em>cc/bcc</em> field:
<ul><li> Either tap <img alt="add icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-08-57-8cef3c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to access all of your contacts OR
</li><li> Enter a full email address or part of an email address or name and tap <img alt="add icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-08-57-8cef3c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and auto-complete will offer matching contacts if any to eliminate needless typing.
</li></ul>
</li><li> Enter your email <em>Subject</em> and text in the fields below
</li><li> Tap <span class="button">Send</span>
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32236", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 8:51:11 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T08:51:11-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "put field names in italic, add a step about opening the email app", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 8:51:34 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T08:51:34-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:37+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32240,'en-US','add-email-accounts','Add email accounts','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/add-email-accounts','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/add-email-accounts/revision/32240',32231,'2012-09-24T09:40:36-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','clearly separate the first run case',1,'2012-09-24T09:40:52-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
#* If this is the first time you have run the email app, you will be presented with the new account wizard with a selection of email providers. 
#* If this is not the first time, tap [[Image:menu icon]] and then tap [[Image:setting]] and then tap {button Add Account}
# Tap on the email provider for your account.
# Enter your email address and password.
# Tap on {button Next}
# Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!

== Notes ==
{note}
# Your phone must be connected to the internet via WiFi or 3G in order to create your account.
# The email app doesn''t allow you to create a new email account. It only allows you to add an existing email account. If you need a new email account, please create a new account at your email provider''s website before adding it to the email app.
# Only certain email providers are supported. Please see the [[Firefox OS FAQ]] for the official list of supported email providers.
{/note}','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
<ul><li> If this is the first time you have run the email app, you will be presented with the new account wizard with a selection of email providers. 
</li><li> If this is not the first time, tap <img alt="menu icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-10-57-3ce679.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and then tap <img alt="setting" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-15-58-56-799b1c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and then tap <span class="button">Add Account</span>
</li></ul>
</li><li> Tap on the email provider for your account.
</li><li> Enter your email address and password.
</li><li> Tap on <span class="button">Next</span>
</li><li> Your email account will be setup and then you are finished!
</li></ol>
<h2 id="w_notes">Notes</h2>
<div class="note">
<ol><li> Your phone must be connected to the internet via WiFi or 3G in order to create your account.
</li><li> The email app doesn''t allow you to create a new email account. It only allows you to add an existing email account. If you need a new email account, please create a new account at your email provider''s website before adding it to the email app.
</li><li> Only certain email providers are supported. Please see the <a href="/en-US/kb/firefox-os-faq">Firefox OS FAQ</a> for the official list of supported email providers.
</li></ol>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32240", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 9:40:36 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T09:40:36-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "clearly separate the first run case", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 24, 2012, 9:40:52 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-24T09:40:52-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:35+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32318,'en-US','replying-email-firefox-os','Replying to email on Firefox OS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/replying-email-firefox-os','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/replying-email-firefox-os/revision/32318',NULL,'2012-09-26T05:53:43-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!',1,'2012-09-26T05:54:10-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
# Open the email you want to reply to by tapping on it
# At the bottom of the screen, tap [[Image:reply]] to reply only to the sender or tap [[Image:reply all]] to reply to all 
# Fill in the ''''Subject'''', add or modify recipients in the ''''To'''' and ''''cc/bcc'''' fields and then tap on {button Send}. See [[composing and sending email]] for full details.','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Open the email you want to reply to by tapping on it
</li><li> At the bottom of the screen, tap <img alt="reply" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-07-18-05a6e3.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to reply only to the sender or tap <img alt="reply all" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-06-53-d86072.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to reply to all 
</li><li> Fill in the <em>Subject</em>, add or modify recipients in the <em>To</em> and <em>cc/bcc</em> fields and then tap on <span class="button">Send</span>. See <a class="new" href="/en-US/kb/new?title=composing+and+sending+email" title="Page does not exist.">composing and sending email</a> for full details.
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32318", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 5:53:43 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T05:53:43-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 5:54:10 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T05:54:10-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:32+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32319,'en-US','forwarding-email-firefox-os','Forwarding email on Firefox OS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/forwarding-email-firefox-os','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/forwarding-email-firefox-os/revision/32319',NULL,'2012-09-26T06:05:08-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!',1,'2012-09-26T06:05:31-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
# Open the email you want to forward by tapping on it
# At the bottom of the screen, tap [[Image:forward]] to forward the email
# Fill in the ''''Subject'''', add or modify recipients in the ''''To'''' and ''''cc/bcc'''' fields and then tap on {button Send}. See [[composing and sending email]] for full details.','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Open the email you want to forward by tapping on it
</li><li> At the bottom of the screen, tap <img alt="forward" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-15-59-09-146141.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to forward the email
</li><li> Fill in the <em>Subject</em>, add or modify recipients in the <em>To</em> and <em>cc/bcc</em> fields and then tap on <span class="button">Send</span>. See <a class="new" href="/en-US/kb/new?title=composing+and+sending+email" title="Page does not exist.">composing and sending email</a> for full details.
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32319", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 6:05:08 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T06:05:08-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 6:05:31 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T06:05:31-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:30+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32321,'en-US','forwarding-email-firefox-os','Forwarding email on Firefox OS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/forwarding-email-firefox-os','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/forwarding-email-firefox-os/revision/32321',32319,'2012-09-26T06:11:25-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','add a tip for changing the subject!',1,'2012-09-26T06:11:52-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','# To open the email app, tap [[Image:email]]
# Open the email you want to forward by tapping on it
# At the bottom of the screen, tap [[Image:forward]] to forward the email
# Edit the ''''Subject'''' if needed, add or modify recipients in the ''''To'''' and ''''cc/bcc'''' fields, modify the text as needed and then tap on {button Send}. See [[composing and sending email]] for full details.
{note}
''''''Tip'''''': Often when forwarding email, you only want to focus on one aspect of the original email. In that case it''s a good idea to modify the ''''Subject'''' field to concisely describe what you are focusing on and to add some explanatory text to the body of the email.
{note}','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Open the email you want to forward by tapping on it
</li><li> At the bottom of the screen, tap <img alt="forward" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-15-59-09-146141.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to forward the email
</li><li> Edit the <em>Subject</em> if needed, add or modify recipients in the <em>To</em> and <em>cc/bcc</em> fields, modify the text as needed and then tap on <span class="button">Send</span>. See <a class="new" href="/en-US/kb/new?title=composing+and+sending+email" title="Page does not exist.">composing and sending email</a> for full details.
</li></ol>
<div class="note">
<p><strong>Tip</strong>: Often when forwarding email, you only want to focus on one aspect of the original email. In that case it''s a good idea to modify the <em>Subject</em> field to concisely describe what you are focusing on and to add some explanatory text to the body of the email.
</p>
<div class="note">
</div>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32321", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 6:11:25 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T06:11:25-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "add a tip for changing the subject!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 6:11:52 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T06:11:52-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:27+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32326,'en-US','address-email-using-cc-and-bcc-fields-firefox-os','Address an Email using To, CC and BCC fields in Firefox OS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/address-email-using-cc-and-bcc-fields-firefox-os','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/address-email-using-cc-and-bcc-fields-firefox-os/revision/32326',NULL,'2012-09-26T08:04:26-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!',1,'2012-09-26T08:05:05-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','This article is about addressing in the email app, which you can open by tapping [[Image:email]]
== To: ==
''''''To:''''''  The primary recipient(s) of this email.<br>When composing email, tap {button To} to edit.
== CC: ==
''''''CC:'''''' (Carbon Copy) The secondary recipient(s) of this email.<br>
Recipients will see the email addresses of those in the To: and CC: field. When composing email, tap {button cc/bcc} to edit.

== BCC: ==
''''''BCC:'''''' (Blind Carbon Copy) Addresses in this field will have mail sent to them, but recipients won''t know who was in the BCC: field i.e. those in the BCC: field will receive the email but those in the To: and CC: fields won''t know who was in the BCC: field.

If there is no entry in the To: field but only in the BCC: then the mail will be sent to all the BCC recipient(s) and the mail will be displayed to recipients as being sent to "undisclosed recipients" or similar wording by the receiving email program.

When composing email, tap {button cc/bcc} to edit.

<!-- 
uncomment if gmail is actually shipped !

===Special Note for Google users===
Google IMAP mail accounts will remove the names in the BCC list from your sent folder.  That is the sender i.e. you, will have no record of to whom an email was BCCed to.  If you need a record of whom you BCCed in an email, you will have to manually record this yourself before sending the email. This is a feature only of Gmail.
-->

{note}
''''''Tip'''''': Email providers limit the number of people that you can send an email to.  Please check your email provider''s website for the exact limit. If you need to email lots of people, it''s better to use a mailing list or a bulk email service.
{/note}','<p>This article is about addressing in the email app, which you can open by tapping <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</p>
<h2 id="w_to">To:</h2>
<p><strong>To:</strong>  The primary recipient(s) of this email.<br>When composing email, tap <span class="button">To</span> to edit.
</p>
<h2 id="w_cc">CC:</h2>
<p><strong>CC:</strong> (Carbon Copy) The secondary recipient(s) of this email.<br>
Recipients will see the email addresses of those in the To: and CC: field. When composing email, tap <span class="button">cc/bcc</span> to edit.
</p>
<h2 id="w_bcc">BCC:</h2>
<p><strong>BCC:</strong> (Blind Carbon Copy) Addresses in this field will have mail sent to them, but recipients won''t know who was in the BCC: field i.e. those in the BCC: field will receive the email but those in the To: and CC: fields won''t know who was in the BCC: field.
</p><p>If there is no entry in the To: field but only in the BCC: then the mail will be sent to all the BCC recipient(s) and the mail will be displayed to recipients as being sent to "undisclosed recipients" or similar wording by the receiving email program.
</p><p>When composing email, tap <span class="button">cc/bcc</span> to edit.
</p><p>
</p>
<div class="note">
<p><strong>Tip</strong>: Email providers limit the number of people that you can send an email to.  Please check your email provider''s website for the exact limit. If you need to email lots of people, it''s better to use a mailing list or a bulk email service.
</p>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32326", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 8:04:26 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T08:04:26-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 8:05:05 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T08:05:05-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:25+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (32327,'en-US','address-email-using-cc-and-bcc-fields-firefox-os','Address an Email using To, CC and BCC fields in Firefox OS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/address-email-using-cc-and-bcc-fields-firefox-os','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/address-email-using-cc-and-bcc-fields-firefox-os/revision/32327',32326,'2012-09-26T08:22:13-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','typos',1,'2012-09-26T08:22:34-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','This article is about addressing in the email app, which you can open by tapping [[Image:email]]
== To: ==
''''''To:''''''  The primary recipient(s) of this email.<br>When composing email, tap {button To} to edit.
== CC: ==
''''''CC:'''''' (Carbon Copy) The secondary recipient(s) of this email.<br>
Recipients will see the email addresses of those in the To: and CC: field.<br>
When composing email, tap {button cc/bcc} to edit.

== BCC: ==
''''''BCC:'''''' (Blind Carbon Copy) Addresses in this field will have mail sent to them, but recipients won''t know who was in the BCC: field i.e. those in the BCC: field will receive the email but those in the To: and CC: fields won''t know who was in the BCC: field.

If there is no entry in the To: field but only in the BCC: then the mail will be sent to all the BCC recipient(s) and the mail will be displayed to recipients as being sent to "undisclosed recipients" or similar wording by the receiving email program.<br>
When composing email, tap {button cc/bcc} to edit.

<!-- 
uncomment if gmail is actually shipped !

===Special Note for Google users===
Google IMAP mail accounts will remove the names in the BCC list from your sent folder.  That is the sender i.e. you, will have no record of to whom an email was BCCed to.  If you need a record of whom you BCCed in an email, you will have to manually record this yourself before sending the email. This is a feature only of Gmail.
-->

{note}
''''''Tip'''''': Email providers limit the number of people that you can send an email to.  Please check your email provider''s website for the exact limit. If you need to email lots of people, it''s better to use a mailing list or a bulk email service.
{/note}','<p>This article is about addressing in the email app, which you can open by tapping <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</p>
<h2 id="w_to">To:</h2>
<p><strong>To:</strong>  The primary recipient(s) of this email.<br>When composing email, tap <span class="button">To</span> to edit.
</p>
<h2 id="w_cc">CC:</h2>
<p><strong>CC:</strong> (Carbon Copy) The secondary recipient(s) of this email.<br>
Recipients will see the email addresses of those in the To: and CC: field.<br>
When composing email, tap <span class="button">cc/bcc</span> to edit.
</p>
<h2 id="w_bcc">BCC:</h2>
<p><strong>BCC:</strong> (Blind Carbon Copy) Addresses in this field will have mail sent to them, but recipients won''t know who was in the BCC: field i.e. those in the BCC: field will receive the email but those in the To: and CC: fields won''t know who was in the BCC: field.
</p><p>If there is no entry in the To: field but only in the BCC: then the mail will be sent to all the BCC recipient(s) and the mail will be displayed to recipients as being sent to "undisclosed recipients" or similar wording by the receiving email program.<br>
When composing email, tap <span class="button">cc/bcc</span> to edit.
</p><p>
</p>
<div class="note">
<p><strong>Tip</strong>: Email providers limit the number of people that you can send an email to.  Please check your email provider''s website for the exact limit. If you need to email lots of people, it''s better to use a mailing list or a bulk email service.
</p>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32327", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 8:22:13 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T08:22:13-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "typos", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 26, 2012, 8:22:34 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-26T08:22:34-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:23+00:00');
