# Tap [[Image:menu icon]] and then tap [[Image:contacts icon]]
# You will see a list of your email accounts.
# Tap on the email account you wish to switch to.
# A list of folders for your selected account will be displayed. Tap on a folder to read the email in that folder.','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="email" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-01-13-03-08-0c83f5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Tap <img alt="menu icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-10-57-3ce679.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> and then tap <img alt="contacts icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-01-06-2ea08d.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> You will see a list of your email accounts.
</li><li> Tap on the email account you wish to switch to.
</li><li> A list of folders for your selected account will be displayed. Tap on a folder to read the email in that folder.
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32364", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 27, 2012, 5:25:04 PM", "datetime": "2012-09-27T17:25:04-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first rough draft! help wanted: help us write firefox os documentation by editing this article!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 27, 2012, 5:25:25 PM", "datetime": "2012-09-27T17:25:25-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:18+00:00');
