# Compose your shot and then take a photoby tapping [[Image:camera]] at the bottom
# Your photo will be previewed for half a second. If you know you don''t want this photo, tap [[Image:delete]] to delete it. You can always delete it later from the gallery.','<ol><li> To open the email app, tap <img alt="camera app" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-17-06-cae5d0.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">: (Add in a future revision of this article: screenshot of camera app viewfinder)
</li><li> Compose your shot and then take a photoby tapping <img alt="camera" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-04-09-702338.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> at the bottom
</li><li> Your photo will be previewed for half a second. If you know you don''t want this photo, tap <img alt="delete" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2012-09-19-16-09-12-0ff64a.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to delete it. You can always delete it later from the gallery.
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "32388", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 28, 2012, 8:15:31 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-28T08:15:31-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "first version! work in progress, please help us out by editing if you have time!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 28, 2012, 8:15:48 AM", "datetime": "2012-09-28T08:15:48-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:51:11+00:00');
