</li><li> To try out a theme, simply tap on the theme''s graphic; Firefox will display <strong>"You''re trying it on!"</strong>. To learn more about a theme, tap <span class="button">Theme Info</span>.<br><br><img alt="Android ICS FF19 amo you are trying it on" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-03-05-23-15-08-408ab0.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
