<h1 id="w_how-do-i-organize-my-top-sites-on-the-firefox-home-page">How do I organize my top sites on the Firefox home page?</h1>
<p>Firefox displays websites on the Firefox home page based on how frequently you visit each site and how recently you were there. You can easily pin, edit and delete the sites that show up on the Firefox home page to customize it just the way you want. 
</p><p>You can pin up to six sites. If you have less than six sites pinned, then Firefox will dynamically fill in empty slots with top frequented sites. If you wish to keep a top frequented site, you can do this by pinning the site. If you wish to change the URL of a pinned site, you can edit the URL. 
</p>
<h2 id="w_pin-a-site">Pin a site</h2>
<ol><li> Tap on the title bar and type <em>about:home</em>.
</li><li> Long tap on the site you want to pin and then tap <span class="menu">Pin Site</span>. Firefox will display a visual indicator on the top right to confirm the site has been pinned.
</li></ol>
<p><br><br>The image "Pin site - Android ICS" does not exist.
</p>
<h2 id="w_remove-a-site-by-unpinning-it">Remove a site by unpinning it</h2>
<ol><li> Tap on the title bar and type <em>about:home</em>.
</li><li> Long tap on the site you want to remove and then tap <span class="menu">Unpin Site</span>.
</li></ol>
<p><br><br>The image "Unpin site - Android ICS" does not exist.
</p>
<h2 id="w_edit-a-pinned-sites-url">Edit a pinned site''s URL</h2>
<ol><li> Tap on the title bar and type <em>about:home</em>.
</li><li> Long tap on the site whose URL you want to change and then tap <span class="menu">Edit</span>
</li><li> Type in the site''s URL or choose it from the Top Sites, Bookmarks or History tabs.<br><br>The image "edit site - Android ICS" does not exist.
</li><li> Tap <span class="button">Go</span> to save the new URL.
</li></ol>
<p><br><br>The image "Edit site - Android ICS" does not exist.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "38110", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Mar 26, 2013, 4:17:11 PM", "datetime": "2013-03-26T16:17:11-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "work in progress, please DO NOT APPROVE, needs screenshots", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:49:35+00:00');
