==Remove a site by unpinning it==
* From the Firefox home page, long tap on the site you want to remove and then tap {menu Unpin Site}.
<br/><br/>[[Image:umpin site - Android ICS]]

==Edit a pinned site''s URL==
# From the Firefox home page, long tap on the site you want to remove and then long tap on the site whose URL you want to change and then tap {menu Edit}.<br /><br />[[Image:edit pinned site - Android ICS]]
# Type in the site''s URL or choose it from the Top Sites, Bookmarks or History tabs.<br/><br/>[[Image:edit url of pinned site tap go - Android ICS]]
# Tap {button Go} to save the new URL to the Firefox home page.','<p>When you go to the Firefox home page, Firefox shows your top sites. Learn how to customize this page: how to pin sites to this page and how to edit sites on this page.
</p><div class="for" data-for="not m20" style="display: none;"><p></p><div class="note"><strong>Note:</strong> This applies to the latest Firefox beta version which can be downloaded from <a href="http://www.mozilla.org/beta">mozilla.org/beta</a>.</div>

<p></p></div>
