{for not m20}
[[Template:ApplytoFx|channel=release|slug=mobile]]
{/for}

__TOC__

= How to add Quit back using a Firefox Android add-on =
Here''s how to install an add-on to bring back Quit.
#Tap the menu {button Menu} button [[Template:AndroidMenuLocation]], then tap {button Tools} and tap {button Add-ons}.
#Tap the orange {button Folder} icon in the upper-right of the Add-ons screen. Alternatively you could go directly to https://addons.mozilla.org/android/ to achieve the same result.<br><br>[[Image:Android ICS Orange Folder for Add-ons 320 px wide]] 
# Search for ''''quitnow''''<br/><br />[[Image:search for quit now - ICS Android]]<br /><br /> and tap on it.<br /><br />[[Image:tap on quitnow - Android ICS]]<br /><br />
# Tap {button Add to Firefox}<br /><br />[[Image:add to firefox - quitnow - Android ICS]]<br /><br /> and then tap {button Install} to install the QuitNow add-on. Your Firefox Menu will now have a {button QuitNow} button.<br /><br />[[Image:quitnow in firefox menu - Android ICS]]','<p>For Android version 4 and above, <em>quit</em> was removed from the Firefox menu to meet Google''s application guidelines. If you wish, you can re-add it. Here''s how.
</p><div class="for" data-for="not m20" style="display: none;"><p></p><div class="note"><strong>Note:</strong> This applies to the latest Firefox release version which can be downloaded from <a href="http://www.mozilla.org/mobile">mozilla.org/mobile</a>.</div>
<p></p></div>
<div id="toc"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><ul><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_how-to-add-quit-back-using-a-firefox-android-add-on"><span class="tocnumber">1</span> <span class="toctext">How to add Quit back using a Firefox Android add-on</span></a></li></ul></div>
<h1 id="w_how-to-add-quit-back-using-a-firefox-android-add-on">How to add Quit back using a Firefox Android add-on</h1>
<p>Here''s how to install an add-on to bring back Quit.
</p>
<ol><li>Tap the menu <span class="button">Menu</span> button (either <a href="/en-US/kb/firefox-menu-icon-missing-android-how-access-menu"> at the bottom right on some devices</a> or in the upper right of the browser)
, then tap <span class="button">Tools</span> and tap <span class="button">Add-ons</span>.
</li><li>Tap the orange <span class="button">Folder</span> icon in the upper-right of the Add-ons screen. Alternatively you could go directly to <a href="https://addons.mozilla.org/android/">https://addons.mozilla.org/android/</a> to achieve the same result.<br><br><img alt="Android ICS Orange Folder for Add-ons 320 px wide" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-03-08-13-32-43-c1ffe4.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
</li><li> Search for <em>quitnow</em><br><br><img alt="search for quit now - ICS Android" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-04-02-17-04-01-27e40b.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""><br><br> and tap on it.<br><br><img alt="tap on quitnow - Android ICS" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-04-02-17-06-30-f321ce.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""><br><br>
</li><li> Tap <span class="button">Add to Firefox</span><br><br><img alt="add to firefox - quitnow - Android ICS" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-04-02-17-10-21-a485b5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""><br><br> and then tap <span class="button">Install</span> to install the QuitNow add-on. Your Firefox Menu will now have a <span class="button">QuitNow</span> button.<br><br><img alt="quitnow in firefox menu - Android ICS" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-04-02-17-13-50-f77229.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "38384", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Apr 2, 2013, 10:16:00 AM", "datetime": "2013-04-02T10:16:00-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "work in progress - needs feedback from Michael Verdi", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Apr 2, 2013, 10:20:13 AM", "datetime": "2013-04-02T10:20:13-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:49:05+00:00');
