<h2 id="w_edit-a-pinned-sites-url">Edit a pinned site''s URL</h2>
<ol><li> From the Firefox start screen, long tap on the site you want to remove and then long tap on the site whose URL you want to change and then tap <span class="menu">Edit</span>.<br><br><img alt="edit pinned site - Android ICS" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-03-27-00-03-01-de95b4.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</li><li> Type in the site''s URL or choose it from the Top Sites, Bookmarks or History tabs.<br><br><img alt="edit url of pinned site tap go - Android ICS" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-03-27-00-10-53-9d2a01.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
