As of Firefox 20, it is possible to do some Firefox start screen (home page) customization. 

You can: pin a site, remove a site by unpinning it and edit a pinned site''s url.

Please read the following Knowledge Base Article for complete information and directions:

[[Pin Sites on the Firefox for Android start screen]]

Hope that helps!','<p>Hi:
</p><p>As of Firefox 20, it is possible to do some Firefox start screen (home page) customization. 
</p><p>You can: pin a site, remove a site by unpinning it and edit a pinned site''s url.
</p><p>Please read the following Knowledge Base Article for complete information and directions:
</p><p><a href="/en-US/kb/pin-sites-firefox-android-start-screen">Pin Sites on the Firefox for Android start screen</a>
</p><p>Hope that helps!
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "38491", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Apr 4, 2013, 7:45:39 AM", "datetime": "2013-04-04T07:45:39-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "add canned response for customizing Firefox start screen (home page)", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Apr 4, 2013, 7:45:49 AM", "datetime": "2013-04-04T07:45:49-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:48:38+00:00');
