=How do I start a Firefox Guest Session?=
*Tap the Firefox {button Menu} button [[Template:AndroidMenuLocation]], then tap {menu Tools} and finally tap {menu New Guest Session}.
=How do I end a Firefox Guest Session?=
*Tap the Firefox {button Menu} button [[Template:AndroidMenuLocation]], then tap {menu Exit Guest Session}.','<p>A Firefox guest session allows you to share your browser with somebody else and not have their browsing affect your personal browsing data like saved passwords, history or bookmarks.
