<h1 id="w_how-do-i-end-a-firefox-guest-session">How do I end a Firefox Guest Session?</h1>
<ol><li>Tap the Firefox <span class="button">Menu</span> button (either <a href="/en-US/kb/firefox-menu-icon-missing-android-how-access-menu"> at the bottom right on some devices</a> or in the upper right of the browser)
, then tap <span class="menu">Exit Guest Session</span>.
</li><li> Tap <span class="key">Continue</span> to delete all the browsing data from this guest session and return to a regular session with your personal browsing data.
</li></ol>
