{note} ''''''Note:'''''' Tablets with screens smaller than 7" do not get the tablet user experience.  Tablets smaller than seven inches in screen size, including phablets like the Samsung Galaxy Note I, II and III, get the phone user experience; see [[Getting started with Firefox for mobile]]. {/note}

