<p>Maildir is a single file per email (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Email#Filename_extensions">EML</a>) unlike the current default monolithic single file format  which is one file per folder (known a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mbox">mbox</a>). This storage format has significant benefits:
