#;[[Image:FxiOS-regular-tab-view]]

{note}''''''Learn more about tabs'''''' by visiting [[Use tabs in Firefox for iOS]].{/note}','<p>Firefox lets you change the size of your tabs on the tab list.
</p>
<h1 id="w_compact-tabs">Compact Tabs</h1>
<p>If you prefer to minimize scrolling, set Firefox to use Compact Tabs to see more of them in one view.
</p>
<ol><li>Tap the numeric tab icon at the bottom of the screen.<br><img alt="tabios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2026-04-17-06-44-39-154c58.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" width="400">

</li><li>Tap <span class="menu">Settings</span> in the menu panel.

</li><li>Tap the switch next to <em>Use Compact Tabs</em> to turn it on: <img alt="switchonios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2017-11-01-22-03-04-3327d9.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
<dl><dt><img alt="FxiOS-compact-tab-view" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-12-21-34-39-2973d5.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</dt></dl>
</li></ol>
<h1 id="w_regular-view">Regular view</h1>
<p>To view larger, but fewer tabs on your tab list, turn off Compact Tabs:
</p>
<ol><li>Tap the numeric tab icon at the bottom of the screen.<br><img alt="tabios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2026-04-17-06-44-39-154c58.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" width="400">

</li><li>Tap <span class="menu">Settings</span> in the menu panel.

</li><li>Tap the switch next to <em>Use Compact Tabs</em> to turn it off: <img alt="switchoffios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-07-18-34-36-7e3f4a.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
<dl><dt><img alt="FxiOS-regular-tab-view" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-12-21-29-53-d8dd3a.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</dt></dl>
</li></ol>
<div class="note"><strong>Learn more about tabs</strong> by visiting <a href="/en-US/kb/use-tabs-firefox-ios">Use tabs in Firefox for iOS</a>.</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "101923", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 2:35:29 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T14:35:29-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "add FxiOS-compact-tab-view screenshot", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 2:36:03 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T14:36:03-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 2:36:03 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T14:36:03-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:42:36+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (101924,'en-US','sync-bookmarks-logins-and-browsing-history-firefox','Sync bookmarks, logins and browsing history on Firefox for iOS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/sync-bookmarks-logins-and-browsing-history-firefox','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/sync-bookmarks-logins-and-browsing-history-firefox/revision/101924',101808,'2015-08-12T14:44:38-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','fix broken link to [[How do I set up Firefox Sync?]]',1,'2015-08-12T14:44:52-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,1,'2015-08-12T14:44:52-07:00','rtanglao','approved','If you use Firefox on multiple devices, a free Firefox Account lets you sync your history, open tabs<!--unconfirmed:,bookmarks and passwords--> on all your devices. All you need is an email address and password.

__TOC__

=Part 1: Set up Firefox Accounts=
{note}''''''New Firefox Accounts'''''': if you are creating a new Firefox Account account, start with the device that has all the information you want to sync. {/note}
#[[Template:tabios]]
#[[Template:settingsios]]
#Tap {menu Sign in} to open the ''''Create a Firefox account'''' page.
#Follow the instructions to create an account. Take note of your login information. You will need it to connect your other devices.
#Check your email for the verification link and tap on it to confirm your account.

Once you''ve finished this step, move on to Part 2.

=Part 2: Connect your iOS device=
#[[Template:tabios]]
#[[Template:settingsios]]
#Tap {menu Sign in} to open the ''''Create a Firefox account'''' page.
#Tap ''''''I already have an account'''''' and follow the instructions to log in.

Your information will sync in a few moments. To force a sync at any time, tap {menu Sync Now} in the Firefox ''''Settings'''' menu.

To set up Sync on another device, see:
*''''''Desktop or laptop computers'''''': [[How do I set up Firefox Sync?]]
*''''''Android phones and tablets:'''''': [[Sync bookmarks, tabs, history and passwords on Android]]','<p>If you use Firefox on multiple devices, a free Firefox Account lets you sync your history, open tabs on all your devices. All you need is an email address and password.
</p>
<div id="toc"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><ul><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_part-1-set-up-firefox-accounts"><span class="tocnumber">1</span> <span class="toctext">Part 1: Set up Firefox Accounts</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_part-2-connect-your-ios-device"><span class="tocnumber">2</span> <span class="toctext">Part 2: Connect your iOS device</span></a></li></ul></div>
<h1 id="w_part-1-set-up-firefox-accounts">Part 1: Set up Firefox Accounts</h1>
<div class="note"><strong>New Firefox Accounts</strong>: if you are creating a new Firefox Account account, start with the device that has all the information you want to sync. </div>
<ol><li>Tap the numeric tab icon at the bottom of the screen.<br><img alt="tabios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2026-04-17-06-44-39-154c58.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" width="400">

</li><li>Tap <span class="menu">Settings</span> in the menu panel.

</li><li>Tap <span class="menu">Sign in</span> to open the <em>Create a Firefox account</em> page.
</li><li>Follow the instructions to create an account. Take note of your login information. You will need it to connect your other devices.
</li><li>Check your email for the verification link and tap on it to confirm your account.
</li></ol>
<p>Once you''ve finished this step, move on to Part 2.
</p>
<h1 id="w_part-2-connect-your-ios-device">Part 2: Connect your iOS device</h1>
<ol><li>Tap the numeric tab icon at the bottom of the screen.<br><img alt="tabios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2026-04-17-06-44-39-154c58.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" width="400">

</li><li>Tap <span class="menu">Settings</span> in the menu panel.

</li><li>Tap <span class="menu">Sign in</span> to open the <em>Create a Firefox account</em> page.
</li><li>Tap <strong>I already have an account</strong> and follow the instructions to log in.
</li></ol>
<p>Your information will sync in a few moments. To force a sync at any time, tap <span class="menu">Sync Now</span> in the Firefox <em>Settings</em> menu.
</p><p>To set up Sync on another device, see:
</p>
<ul><li><strong>Desktop or laptop computers</strong>: <a href="/en-US/kb/how-do-i-set-sync-my-computer">How do I set up Sync on my computer?</a>
</li><li><strong>Android phones and tablets:</strong>: <a href="/en-US/kb/sync-bookmarks-tabs-history-and-passwords-android">Sync bookmarks, history, passwords and tabs on Android</a>
</li></ul>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "101924", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 2:44:38 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T14:44:38-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "fix broken link to [[How do I set up Firefox Sync?]]", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 2:44:52 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T14:44:52-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 2:44:52 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T14:44:52-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:42:33+00:00');
