#;[[Image:FxiOS-remove-reading-list-article]]','<p>Short on time? Save web pages to your Reading List and read them later on your iPhone, iPad or iPod.
</p>
<h1 id="w_add-a-page-to-your-reading-list">Add a page to your Reading List</h1>
<ol><li>The template "shareios" does not exist or has no approved revision.
</li><li>Tap Firefox on the menu that pops up.
</li><li>Put a check mark next to <span class="menu">Add to Reading List</span> if it isn''t already checked. (Optional: remove the check mark next to <span class="menu">Add to Bookmarks</span> if you do not wish to bookmark the page.)
</li><li>Tap <strong>Add</strong> to finish.
</li></ol>
<p>

</p><p><br>
</p>
<h1 id="w_view-your-reading-list">View your Reading List</h1>
<p>Ready for some reading? Follow these steps to view your Reading List:
</p>
<ol><li>Tap the address bar to bring up the home screen.
</li><li>Tap the Reading List icon <img alt="Reader mode" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2013-11-06-14-47-35-636dcd.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> to view your list.
<dl><dt><img alt="FxiOS-sample-reading-list" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-12-23-24-01-06542f.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</dt></dl>
</li><li>To remove a web page, swipe left and tap <strong>Remove</strong>.
<dl><dt><img alt="FxiOS-remove-reading-list-article" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-12-23-33-46-6d0e46.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">
</dt></dl>
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "101931", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 4:34:42 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T16:34:42-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "add remove a page from reader view screenshot", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 4:35:37 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T16:35:37-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization", "text": "Aug 12, 2015, 4:35:37 PM", "datetime": "2015-08-12T16:35:37-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:42:26+00:00');
