"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization", "text": "Jul 18, 2017, 12:49:55 AM", "datetime": "2017-07-18T00:49:55-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization by", "text": "heyjoni", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:41:12+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (141385,'en-US','templatesettingsios','Template:settingsios','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/templatesettingsios','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/templatesettingsios/revision/141385',135010,'2017-07-14T07:31:43-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','work in progress, needs joni''s edits before RFL',1,'2017-07-14T07:32:07-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','Tap the menu button at the bottom of the screen. (You might need to [[Navigation bar in Firefox for iOS|scroll all the way to the top of the page]] for the menu button to appear).

Tap the ''''''Settings'''''' icon in the menu panel at the bottom of the screen. (You might need to swipe to the next panel first.)

{note}''''''Don''t see a menu button?'''''' You might be on an older version of Firefox. Please update to the latest version through the App Store.<br>

<!--
Tap the ''''''Settings'''''' icon in the menu panel at the bottom of the screen. (You might need to swipe to the next panel first.)
{note}''''''Don''t see a menu button?'''''' You might be on an older version of Firefox. Tap the cogwheel icon to open the Firefox ''''Settings'''' menu or update to the latest version through the App Store.<br>
[[Image:settings ios]] {/note}
-->','<p>Tap the menu button at the bottom of the screen. (You might need to <a href="/en-US/kb/navigation-bar-firefox-ios">scroll all the way to the top of the page</a> for the menu button to appear).
</p><p>Tap the <strong>Settings</strong> icon in the menu panel at the bottom of the screen. (You might need to swipe to the next panel first.)
</p>
<div class="note"><strong>Don''t see a menu button?</strong> You might be on an older version of Firefox. Please update to the latest version through the App Store.<br>
<p>
</p>
</div>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "141385", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Jul 14, 2017, 7:31:43 AM", "datetime": "2017-07-14T07:31:43-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "work in progress, needs joni''s edits before RFL", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Jul 14, 2017, 7:32:07 AM", "datetime": "2017-07-14T07:32:07-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:41:09+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (141386,'en-US','what-version-firefox-do-i-have-ios','Which version of Firefox am I using?','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/what-version-firefox-do-i-have-ios','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/what-version-firefox-do-i-have-ios/revision/141386',107175,'2017-07-14T07:33:43-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','work in progress, needs joni''s edits before RFL',1,'2017-07-14T07:33:58-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,0,NULL,NULL,'approved','[[Template:ioscoming]]

The newest version of Firefox for iOS contains the latest security updates and features. Follow these steps to find out what version you have:

<!--#[[Template:tabios]]-->
#[[Template:settingsios]]
#Scroll down to the ''''About'''' section. The version number is listed there.
<!--Screenshot-->','<p></p><div class="warning"> This article shows an upcoming version of Firefox for iOS, so yours might look different. Please update in a few weeks to get these features.</div>
<p></p><p>The newest version of Firefox for iOS contains the latest security updates and features. Follow these steps to find out what version you have:
</p><p>
</p>
<ol><li>Tap <span class="menu">Settings</span> in the menu panel.

</li><li>Scroll down to the <em>About</em> section. The version number is listed there.
</li></ol>
<p>
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "141386", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Jul 14, 2017, 7:33:43 AM", "datetime": "2017-07-14T07:33:43-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "work in progress, needs joni''s edits before RFL", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Jul 14, 2017, 7:33:58 AM", "datetime": "2017-07-14T07:33:58-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:41:07+00:00');
INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (141387,'en-US','navigation-bar-firefox-ios','Navigation bar in Firefox for iOS','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/navigation-bar-firefox-ios','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/navigation-bar-firefox-ios/revision/141387',128776,'2017-07-14T07:50:23-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','WIP: PLEASE DON''T APPROVE until Joni has taken a look',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'unreviewed','[[Template:ioscoming]]

The navigation bar lets you navigate web pages quickly and easily, by placing the essential buttons at the bottom of the screen:
*Back [[Image:back ios]]: return to a previous page.
*Forward [[Image:forward ios]]: return from a previous page.

*;{note}''''''Tip:'''''' Jump to any page in your tab history by tapping and holding on the Back or Forward button.{/note}

*Reload [[Image:refresh ios]]: refresh a page.
*Share [[Image:share button ios]]: send a web page to your [[Add web pages to your Reading List | Reading List]] or to another app (Message, Mail or other installed apps).
<!--
*Bookmark [[Image:bookmark ios]]: save a page to your bookmarks.
-->

=Where did the navigation bar go?=
To give you more screen space, Firefox hides the navigation bar as you scroll down a page. To make the navigation bar visible again, scroll all the way to the top of the page:

;[[Image:ios 5 navigation bar]]','<p></p><div class="warning"> This article shows an upcoming version of Firefox for iOS, so yours might look different. Please update in a few weeks to get these features.</div>
<p></p><p>The navigation bar lets you navigate web pages quickly and easily, by placing the essential buttons at the bottom of the screen:
</p>
<ul><li>Back <img alt="back ios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-10-19-55-33-469bba.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">: return to a previous page.
</li><li>Forward <img alt="forward ios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-10-19-56-09-965dba.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">: return from a previous page.
</li></ul>
<ul><li><dl><dt><div class="note"><strong>Tip:</strong> Jump to any page in your tab history by tapping and holding on the Back or Forward button.</div>
</dt></dl>
</li></ul>
<ul><li>Reload <img alt="refresh ios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-10-19-56-43-03b625.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">: refresh a page.
</li><li>Share <img alt="share button ios" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2015-08-10-19-57-09-85e47a.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">: send a web page to your <a href="/en-US/kb/add-web-pages-your-reading-list-firefox-ios"> Reading List</a> or to another app (Message, Mail or other installed apps).
</li></ul>
<p>
</p>
<h1 id="w_where-did-the-navigation-bar-go">Where did the navigation bar go?</h1>
<p>To give you more screen space, Firefox hides the navigation bar as you scroll down a page. To make the navigation bar visible again, scroll all the way to the top of the page:
</p>
