</p>
<ol><li> Tap the menu button at the bottom of the screen. (You might need to <a href="/en-US/kb/navigation-bar-firefox-ios">scroll all the way to the top of the page</a> for the menu button to appear).
</li><li>Tap the <strong>Night Mode</strong> icon to reduce the brightness. (You might need to swipe to the next panel first.)
</li></ol>
<p>To set Firefox for iOS back to normal brightness, repeat the above two steps.
</p>
<dl><dt><img alt="ffios8-night-mode" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2017-07-16-23-03-29-91ab40.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
