= 1. Spaces Toolbar = 
= 2. Universal Toolbar = 
= 3. Tab Bar = 
= 4. Message List Header = 
= 5. Folder Pane = 
= 6. Quick Filter Bar = 
= 7. Message List Pane = 
= 8. Message Header = 
= 9. Message Pane =
= 10. Today Pane = 
= 11. Status Bar =','<p>This article describes Thunderbird''s main window, as seen below. Refer also to the many <a class="new" href="/en-US/kb/new?title=keyboard+shortcuts+TB" title="Page does not exist.">keyboard shortcuts</a> available in the main window to help you quickly perform functions, such as message actions and navigation, searching and calendar actions. 
<img alt="tb115-classic-table-view" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-07-06-21-21-08-fb78b9.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
</p>
<div id="toc"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><ul><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_1-spaces-toolbar"><span class="tocnumber">1</span> <span class="toctext">1. Spaces Toolbar</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_2-universal-toolbar"><span class="tocnumber">2</span> <span class="toctext">2. Universal Toolbar</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_3-tab-bar"><span class="tocnumber">3</span> <span class="toctext">3. Tab Bar</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_4-message-list-header"><span class="tocnumber">4</span> <span class="toctext">4. Message List Header</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_5-folder-pane"><span class="tocnumber">5</span> <span class="toctext">5. Folder Pane</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_6-quick-filter-bar"><span class="tocnumber">6</span> <span class="toctext">6. Quick Filter Bar</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_7-message-list-pane"><span class="tocnumber">7</span> <span class="toctext">7. Message List Pane</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_8-message-header"><span class="tocnumber">8</span> <span class="toctext">8. Message Header</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_9-message-pane"><span class="tocnumber">9</span> <span class="toctext">9. Message Pane</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_10-today-pane"><span class="tocnumber">10</span> <span class="toctext">10. Today Pane</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_11-status-bar"><span class="tocnumber">11</span> <span class="toctext">11. Status Bar</span></a></li></ul></div>
<h1 id="w_1-spaces-toolbar">1. Spaces Toolbar</h1>
<h1 id="w_2-universal-toolbar">2. Universal Toolbar</h1>
<h1 id="w_3-tab-bar">3. Tab Bar</h1>
<h1 id="w_4-message-list-header">4. Message List Header</h1>
<h1 id="w_5-folder-pane">5. Folder Pane</h1>
<h1 id="w_6-quick-filter-bar">6. Quick Filter Bar</h1>
<h1 id="w_7-message-list-pane">7. Message List Pane</h1>
<h1 id="w_8-message-header">8. Message Header</h1>
