INSERT INTO revisions (revision_id, locale, article_slug, article_title, article_url, revision_url, previous_revision_id, created, creator_name, creator_url, comment, reviewed, reviewed_date, reviewed_by, is_approved, is_current, ready_for_l10n, readied_for_l10n_date, readied_for_l10n_by, status, source, content_html, info_json, scraped_at) VALUES (262975,'en-US','quick-filter-toolbar','Quick Filter Toolbar','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/quick-filter-toolbar','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/quick-filter-toolbar/revision/262975',262560,'2023-07-07T07:06:18-07:00','Roland Tanglao','https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/','fix showfor to only show for specific version by using "for =tb102" and "for =tb115"',1,'2023-07-07T07:06:37-07:00','rtanglao',1,0,1,'2023-07-07T07:06:37-07:00','rtanglao','approved','{for =tb102}[[Image:tb102-quick-filter-main]]{/for} 
{for =tb115}[[Image:tb115-quick-filter-bar-main]]{/for}

The Quick Filter Bar helps you sort your message list based on specific criterias. You can filter your messages based on the following filters:

{|
|''''''Filter''''''||''''''Action''''''
|-
| {button [[Image:tb-icon-pin]]&nbsp; Pin}  || Keep filters applied when switching folders.
|-
| {button [[Image:tb-icon-unread]]&nbsp;  Unread}|| Show only unread messages.
|-
|{button [[Image:tb-icon-starred]]&nbsp; Starred}|| Show only starred messages.
|-
|{button [[Image:tb-icon-address-book]]&nbsp; Contact}|| Show only messages from people in your address book.
|-
|{button [[Image:tb-icon-tag]]&nbsp; Tags}|| Show only messages with tags on them.
|-
|{button [[Image:tb-icon-attachment]]&nbsp; Attachment}|| Show only messages with attachments.
|}

To show or hide the Quick Filter Bar, click on {button [[Image:tb-icon-filter]]&nbsp; Quick Filter} in the {for tb102}Mail Toolbar{/for}{for tb115}Message List Header{/for}. You can also reveal it by pressing {key Ctrl+Shift+K} or hide it by pressing {key Esc}. 

{for =tb102}[[Image:tb102-quick-filter-search]]{/for} 
{for =tb115}[[Image:tb115-quick-filter-bar-search]]{/for}

When you enter filter terms in the search box, you will be given the option to apply filters to limit your search to the Sender, Recipients, Subject and/or Body of the messages. Right-click on the relevant buttons to apply the desired filters. 

== Searching for multiple tags ==

{for =tb102}[[Image:tb102-quick-filter-tags]]{/for} 
{for =tb115}[[Image:tb115-quick-filter-bar-tags]]{/for}

When clicking on the Tags filter, you will see a dropdown menu and a list of all your tags. The drop down menu offers two filtering mode:

{|
|''''''Filter''''''||''''''Action''''''
|-
|All of|| Show message where all the selected tag criteria must match.
|-
|Any of|| Show messages where at least one of the selected tag criteria should match.
|}

To limit your search to certain tags, right-click on them.','<p><span class="for" data-for="=tb102" style="display: none;"><img alt="tb102-quick-filter-main" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-06-29-12-57-18-9d6237.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""></span> 
