<p>To show or hide the Quick Filter Bar, click on <span class="button"><img alt="tb-icon-filter" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-06-28-13-51-05-028e3d.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title="">&nbsp; Quick Filter</span> in the <span class="for" data-for="tb102">Mail Toolbar</span><span class="for" data-for="tb115">Message List Header</span>. You can also reveal it by pressing <span class="key">Ctrl</span> + <span class="key">Shift</span> + <span class="key">K</span> or hide it by pressing <span class="key">Esc</span>. 
