</p><p>When you enter filter terms in the search box, you will be given the option to apply filters to limit your search to the Sender, Recipients, Subject and/or Body of the messages. Right-click on the relevant buttons to apply the desired filters. 
</p>
<h2 id="w_searching-for-multiple-tags">Searching for multiple tags</h2>
<p><span class="for" data-for="=tb102" style="display: none;"><img alt="tb102-quick-filter-tags" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-06-29-12-58-08-3cd3bf.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""></span> 
<span class="for" data-for="=tb115" style="display: none;"><img alt="tb115-quick-filter-bar-tags" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-06-29-12-33-12-8bee3d.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""></span>
</p><p>When clicking on the Tags filter, you will see a dropdown menu and a list of all your tags. The drop down menu offers two filtering mode:
</p>
<table>
<tbody><tr>
<td><strong>Filter</strong></td><td><strong>Action</strong>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>All of</td><td> Show message where all the selected tag criteria must match.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Any of</td><td> Show messages where at least one of the selected tag criteria should match.
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>To limit your search to certain tags, right-click on them.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "262975", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Jul 7, 2023, 7:06:18 AM", "datetime": "2023-07-07T07:06:18-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "fix showfor to only show for specific version by using \"for =tb102\" and \"for =tb115\"", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Jul 7, 2023, 7:06:37 AM", "datetime": "2023-07-07T07:06:37-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization", "text": "Jul 7, 2023, 7:06:37 AM", "datetime": "2023-07-07T07:06:37-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:38:40+00:00');
