<ul><li> select "Vertical View": click <span class="menu">≡</span> &gt; <span class="menu">Layout</span> &gt; <span class="menu">Vertical View</span> and then 
</li><li> select "Card View": click the "Message list display options" icon <img alt="tb115-display-options-icon" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-07-07-21-52-22-a4fad4.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> (which is to the right of <span class="button">Quick Filter</span>) &gt; <span class="menu">Cards View</span>
</li></ul>
<p><img alt="tb115-vertical-card-view" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-07-06-22-49-37-2dd39c.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
