<h1 id="w_classic-view-layout-with-table-view">Classic View Layout with Table View</h1>
<p>The following screenshot shows the Clasic View Layout with Table View. It is the default layout for new Thunderbird installs.
</p><p><img alt="tb115-classic-table-view" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-07-06-21-21-08-fb78b9.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
