<p>Refer also to the many <a class="new" href="/en-US/kb/new?title=keyboard+shortcuts+TB" title="Page does not exist.">keyboard shortcuts</a> available in the main window to help you quickly perform functions, such as message actions and navigation, searching and calendar actions. 
</p>
