</li><li> A new Card View for messages can be turned on by clicking the new <em>Message list display options</em> icon (which is on the right of the <em>Quick Filter</em> icon): <img alt="tb115-display-options-icon-offical-from-micah" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2023-07-09-20-04-06-4a2c27.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> &gt; <span class="menu">Cards View</span>. Please see: <a href="/en-US/kb/getting-started-thunderbird-main-window-supernova#w_vertical-view-layout-with-card-view">Getting Started with the Thunderbird main window (Supernova and newer)</a>.
</li></ul>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "266092", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Sep 25, 2023, 7:37:12 AM", "datetime": "2023-09-25T07:37:12-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "WIP please do not localize, ping Roland with any questions please!", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Sep 26, 2023, 12:11:34 PM", "datetime": "2023-09-26T12:11:34-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "wsmwk", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:36:44+00:00');
