|Open message or folder in a new tab in the background||''''Middle-click'''' the message or folder, ''''''''''or''''''''''<br>''''Right-click'''' the message or folder, then choose {menu Open Message in New Tab} or {menu Open in New Tab} from the context menu
|-
|Open message or folder in a new tab in the foreground||{key Shift} + ''''Middle-click'''' the message or folder, ''''''''''or''''''''''<br>''''Right-click'''' the message or folder, then hold {key Shift} while choosing {menu Open Message in New Tab} or {menu Open in New Tab} from the context menu
