</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Go to Previous Message</td><td><span class="key">B</span>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Go to Next Unread Message</td><td><span class="key">N</span>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Go to Previous Unread Message</td><td><span class="key">P</span>
</td></tr>
<tr>
