</li></ol>
</div><div class="for" data-for="linux" style="display: none;">
<ol><li> <a href="https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/thunderbird/releases/1.5.0.14/linux-i686/en-US/">1.5.0.14</a>
</li><li> <a href="https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/thunderbird/releases/2.0.0.24/linux-i686/en-US/">2.0.0.24</a>
