The process is: 
</p><ol><li> Manually download the next version in the following list, install it and <div class="note"><strong>Important:</strong> Once you have upgraded, open Thunderbird at least once before continuing.</div>
</li><li> Repeat until you get to Thunderbird 60.9.0
