<ul><li> Click <span class="menu">≡</span>  &gt; <span class="menu">Help</span>  &gt; <span class="menu">About Thunderbird</span> (<span class="menu">About Mozilla Thunderbird</span> in TB60)
</li><li> Click <span class="button">Restart Thunderbird</span> (<span class="button">{Restart to update Thunderbird</span> in TB60)
</li><li> Wait for the newly upgraded Thunderbird to open
</li></ul>
<p>And that''s it, you''ve now upgraded to the latest version of Thunderbird! The interface may have changed a bit from the version you were previously on. We recommend spending a bit of time familiarizing yourself with any interface changes
</p>
<h1 id="w_edge-case-for-those-on-versions-older-than-60">Edge Case: For those on versions older than 60</h1>
