= Mailing List improvements = 

You can now unsubscribe to mailing lists, open list archives (on the web) etc. for mailing lists that support standard headers such as ''''''List-Unsubscribe'''''' and ''''''List-Archive'''''', etc.','<p></p><div class="warning">More for Thunderbird: <strong>o</strong> Vote on &amp; suggest improvements at <a href="https://connect.mozilla.org/t5/ideas/idb-p/ideas/label-name/thunderbird">Connect</a> <strong>o</strong> <a href="https://www.thunderbird.net/participate/">Participate/Contribute</a> <strong>o</strong> <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/questions/new/thunderbird/form">Get Support</a></div>
