</li><li> Ensure the email accounts you want to import are all ticked. Tap <span class="button">Import</span>.
</li><li> If your account uses OAuth or you have chosen not to import your passwords, you will be prompted for your passwords.
</li></ol>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "286783", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Oct 15, 2024, 5:33:02 PM", "datetime": "2024-10-15T17:33:02.046090-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "fix typo, needs approval from Wayne and others", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Oct 15, 2024, 5:33:22 PM", "datetime": "2024-10-15T17:33:22.247816-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:32:33+00:00');
