<h2 id="w_what-is-happening-with-exchange-support">What is happening with Exchange Support?</h2>
<p>Thunderbird for Android does not currently support the Microsoft Exchange protocol; just IMAP, POP and SMTP. The team is investigating how this could be done. Please keep on a eye on our <a href="https://blog.thunderbird.net/category/mobile-news/">blog</a> for future news.
</p>
<h2 id="w_what-is-happening-with-thunderbird-sync">What is happening with Thunderbird Sync?</h2>
<ul><li> We are building our own sync storage server and it is taking some time to set it up and test. We will let you know when it is available for public pre-release testing.
</li><li> In the meantime, you can reuse your email account settings from Thunderbird Desktop via a QR code or import your settings from K-9 or from a file. Please see <a href="/en-US/kb/thunderbird-android-import">Import settings and data into Thunderbird for Android</a> for full details.
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_what-is-happening-with-k-9">What is happening with K-9?</h2>
<ul><li> K-9 is not going away anytime soon. You can continue to use it as you are using it today.
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_if-i-am-on-thunderbird-for-android-beta-what-happens-when-thunderbird-for-android-is-released">If I am on Thunderbird for Android beta, what happens when Thunderbird for Android is released?</h2>
<p>Nothing will happen, because you will continue to be on the Thunderbird for Android beta channel. 
</p><p>But you can switch to the release channel and not lose your settings by following the instructions at: <a href="/en-US/kb/thunderbird-android-import">Import settings and data into Thunderbird for Android</a> to export your Thunderbird for Android beta settings to Thunderbird for Android release.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "287708", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Oct 29, 2024, 7:44:35 PM", "datetime": "2024-10-29T19:44:35.411077-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "WIP do not localize, needs review by Philipp and Wayne and Monica; see https://github.com/thunderbird/android-knowledgebase-issues/issues/2#issuecomment-2444585827", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:31:24+00:00');
