</li><li> Another workaround may be logging in on Thunderbird Desktop, and then afterwards trying to log in on Thunderbird for Android.
</li></ul>
<h3 id="w_workaround-for-google-advanced-protection-errors-such-as-admin-policy-enforced">Workaround for Google Advanced Protection errors such as "admin_policy_enforced"</h3>
