<span class="for" data-for="tb45"><span class="for" data-for="win" style="display: none;"><img alt="Remote content blocking options Win TB45" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2016-04-14-10-51-09-3e7d0b.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""></span></span><span class="for" data-for="not tb115" style="display: none;"><span class="for" data-for="mac,linux"><img alt="Remote content blocking options TB45" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2016-06-25-09-51-48-ba4a40.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""></span></span>
</p>
<ul><li> <span class="menu">Show remote content in this message</span> to show remote content just for this particular message.
</li><li> <span class="menu">Edit remote content <span class="for" data-for="win" style="display: none;">options</span><span class="for" data-for="mac,linux">preferences</span>…</span> to display remote content by default (see next section).
