</li><li> <strong>Thunderbird Daily</strong> is updated daily.
</li><li> Make sure your installer does not install <strong>Daily</strong> in a non-Daily program directory - official Mozilla downloads should do this correctly. See <a href="#w_how-to-install-and-run-daily">How to install and run Daily</a> for more information.
</li><li> If you use Thunderbird mail filters and you have more than one Thunderbird data profile, decide where you want to run your filters - in your <strong>Daily</strong> profile or your other profile. Do not use filters in both. 
