<h2 id="w_thunderbird-137" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-14" aria-expanded="false">Thunderbird 137</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-14" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> Fixed Two-factor authentication via text or email for Office 365 using Oauth2.
</li></ul><p></p></div>

</section>
