|-
|Clear History||{for win,linux}{key Ctrl+Shift+Del}{/for}{for mac}{key Command+Shift+Del}{/for}
|}','<p>Keyboard shortcuts are quick key combinations that let you perform certain tasks in Thunderbird faster. For example, if you want to <a href="/en-US/kb/archived-messages">archive a message</a>, you can simply strike the <span class="key">a</span> (this is case sensitive, uppercase <span class="key">A</span> doesn''t work) 
key rather than using the mouse to click the option in a menu. Some shortcuts can be customized or disabled with the use of an add-on.
</p>
