<h2 id="w_writing-messages">Writing messages</h2>
<p><a href="#w_moving-around-thunderbird">&nbsp;&nbsp;←&nbsp;</a> | <a href="#w_list-of-keyboard-shortcuts">&nbsp;&nbsp;↑&nbsp;&nbsp;</a> | <a href="#w_address-book">&nbsp;&nbsp;→ </a>
