Android''s settings and automatic screen dimming can make it difficult to read the screen in Thunderbird. Here''s some tips and tricks.

=Thunderbird''s Dark Theme=
*# Tap {button ≡} at the top left > tap the gear icon:{button [[Image:gear icon]]} at the bottom left.
*# Tap {button General settings} > tap {menu Display} > tap {button Dark} under ''''''Theme''''''Android tip

