</li><li> Tap <span class="button">General settings</span> &gt; tap <span class="menu">Display</span>. Tap whatever works best: <span class="button">Dark</span> or <span class="button">Light</span> or <span class="button">Use system default</span> under <strong>Theme</strong>.
