<h1 id="w_thunderbird-147">Thunderbird 147</h1>
<ul><li> <span class="menu">Reset Folder Order</span> has been fixed (see the 142 section). It now restores the original location of a folder that was moved inside another parent folder.
</li><li> All outstanding issues with localization of folder names have been fixed. If you notice any other issues, please <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/questions/new/thunderbird">file a Thunderbird desktop support request</a>.
</li></ul>
