<p>Go forth! Set up some office hours with Appointment. Send some files with Send. Send and receive email with Thundermail using your Thundermail Address Book, Thundermail aliases and Thundermail Catch-All addresses. Use your Thundermail Calendar to setup events.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "327486", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "May 2, 2026, 12:30:33 AM", "datetime": "2026-05-02T00:30:33.739729-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Roland Tanglao", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/rtanglao/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "WIP please do not translate. Discussion please at: https://github.com/thunderbird/knowledgebase-issues/issues/191", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "May 2, 2026, 12:32:13 AM", "datetime": "2026-05-02T00:32:13.624454-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "rtanglao", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T18:21:46+00:00');
