</li><li> <strong>Restricted Privileges</strong>: Once verified, the Bank issues Thunderbird an Access Token. This token only grants the ability to read and send emails (and perhaps contacts and calendars) —it cannot be used for anything else (e.g.&nbsp;Google Photos or Microsoft’s One Drive), to change your account password, or lock you out.
