<h1 id="w_how-do-i-troubleshoot-oauth-issues">How do I troubleshoot OAuth issues?</h1>
<p>If your email provider is using OAuth 2 and you see authentication or authorization errors, then please follow this checklist:
</p>
<ol><li> <strong>OAuth requires JavaScript and cookies,</strong> which may not be enabled in your system web browser. They must be enabled in order for OAuth2 to work. Please double check they are enabled (consult your system browser’s documentation). For example, Firefox’s documentation can be found at <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/products/firefox">support.mozilla.org/products/firefox</a>
