f="#w_redesigned-account-hub"><span class="tocnumber">14.4</span> <span class="toctext">Redesigned Account hub</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_manual-folder-sorting"><span class="tocnumber">14.5</span> <span class="toctext">Manual Folder Sorting</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_experimental-exchange-support-for-advanced-users"><span class="tocnumber">14.6</span> <span class="toctext">Experimental Exchange Support for advanced users</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_export-for-mobile"><span class="tocnumber">14.7</span> <span class="toctext">Export for Mobile</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_horizontal-scroll-for-table-view"><span class="tocnumber">14.8</span> <span class="toctext">Horizontal Scroll for Table View</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_older-releases"><span class="tocnumber">15</span> <span class="toctext">Older Releases</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-139"><span class="tocnumber">15.1</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 139</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-138"><span class="tocnumber">15.2</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 138</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-137"><span class="tocnumber">15.3</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 137</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-136"><span class="tocnumber">15.4</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 136</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></div>
<h1 id="w_thunderbird-153-esr-153-meadow">Thunderbird 153 / ESR 153 "Meadow"</h1>
<ul><li> All the improvements since 140.
</li><li> Unified folders display your custom account color indicator with an account name tooltip.
</li><li> <a href="/en-US/kb/tb-oauth">OAuth</a>login for email accounts (for example: gmail, Thundermail, etc) opens in the system default web brwoser. 152, and older opened the OAuth login in a Thunderbird tab.
</li></ul>
<p></p><section class="mzp-c-details is-details">
<p></p>
<h1 id="w_thunderbird-152">Thunderbird 152</h1>
<h2 id="w_improved-thundermail-configuration" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-0" aria-expanded="false">Improved Thundermail configuration</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-0" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> One-click account setup for [[Thunderbird for Desktop and Thundermail|Thundermail] accounts.
</li></ul><p></p></div>

</section>
