<h3 id="w_per-account-oauth2-microsoft-exchange-customization" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-3" aria-expanded="false">Per-account OAuth2 Microsoft Exchange customization</button></h3><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-3" aria-hidden="true"><h4 id="w_general-setup-instructions">General Setup Instructions</h4><ol><li> Add a new email account: Thunderbird app menu <span class="menu">☰</span> &gt; <span class="menu">Add Account</span> &gt; <span class="menu">Email</span> and enter a Microsoft 365 email address e.g. <code>nemo@o365.thunderbird.net</code> and then click <strong>MANUAL CONFIGURATION</strong> on the bottom left of the Account hub.
</li><li> Click <span class="button">Microsoft Exchange or Microsoft 365</span> and then click <span class="button">Set up account</span>.
</li><li> In the <strong>Exchange settings</strong> dialog, type one of the following URLs into the <strong>Enter the service URL</strong> field:
