{note}''''''NOTE'''''': For most Thunderbird users, Thunderbird''s built-in OAuth2 support for many common providers (like Google, Microsoft, Yahoo and AOL) is sufficient. If you don''t need to customize your OAuth configuration, you can safely ignore this article.{/note}
