# Add a new email account: Thunderbird app menu {menu ☰} > {menu Add Account} > {menu Email} and enter an email address on an IMAP Provider e.g. <code>nemo@thundermail.com</code> and then click ''''''MANUAL CONFIGURATION'''''' on the bottom left of the Account hub.
# Click {button IMAP - Sync across devices} and then click {button Set up account}.
# In the ''''''IMAP settings'''''' dialog, enter the IMAP settings from your provider. Be sure to select {menu OAuth2} for ''''''Authentication Method''''''.
