</li><li> In the left sidebar, click on your Thundermail account. For example: <strong>nemo@thundermail.com</strong>. Then, click on the chevron “&gt;” to expand the drop down menu. Finally, click on <span class="menu">Server Settings</span> and set the following values:
</li></ol><ul><li> <strong>Server Name:</strong> <a href="http://mail.thundermail.com">mail.thundermail.com</a>
</li><li> <strong>Server Port:</strong> 993
</li><li> <strong>Security:</strong> SSL/TLS
</li><li> <strong>Username:</strong> your full Thundermail address e.g. <strong>nemo@thundermail.com</strong>
