<h1 id="w_configuring-filelink">Configuring Filelink</h1>
<p>To use Filelink, you must first create a new account (or configure an existing account) with an online storage service provider. 
</p><p>The template "optionspreferences tb" does not exist or has no approved revision. Click on the <span class="button">Attachments</span> button, then click <span class="button">Outgoing</span>. Select the desired service provider from the drop-down list. Click the <span class="button">Add</span> button. Enter the username for  your online storage account, or click link to create an accout with your selected provider.
