</p><p><img alt="FileLinkLinkingMessage" class="wiki-image frameless lazy" data-original-src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/media/uploads/gallery/images/2014-05-05-00-17-58-59e694.png" src="https://assets-prod.sumo.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net/static/placeholder.cb78bf81388965e3.gif" title=""> 
</p><p>When the linking is complete, that is your attachment has been uploaded to the service provider your email will be modified and a block of text and a link will be added to the body of your email as shown below.
