</li><li> Click the <strong>Attachment</strong> panel and choose the <strong>Outgoing</strong> tab.
</li><li> Set the file size for Filelink warning.
</li></ul>
<p>The offer to upload can also be disabled entirely by removing the selection from the <strong>Offer to share for files larger than</strong> option.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "84627", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Dec 15, 2014, 12:14:55 AM", "datetime": "2014-12-15T00:14:55-08:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Artist", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/Artist/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "minor text edits", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T20:08:12+00:00','');
