<h2 id="w_q-can-you-support-service-provider-x-or-protocol-y">Q: Can you support service provider X or protocol Y?</h2>
<p>A: We plan to support SpiderOak. We also have an "<a href="http://blog.mozilla.org/thunderbird/">Up-for-grabs</a>" project available if anybody would like to add support for more services or protocols. Also have a look at the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en/Thunderbird/Filelink_Providers">Developer documentation for the Filelink feature</a>.
</p>
