{warning}''''''Newer Gmail accounts won''t work with Thunderbird 31 and older versions because these versions don''t support Google''s authentication'''''' ([https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=849540 bug 849540] contains the full technical details). Please make sure that [[Updating Thunderbird|you are using Thunderbird 38 or newer]] before configuring your account.{/warning}

