<p>A: The file will remain available on the storage service provider''s site until you specifically delete it. Log in to the provider''s website to view and delete the files in your storage space.
</p>
<h2 id="w_q-can-you-support-service-provider-x-or-protocol-y">Q: Can you support service provider X or protocol Y?</h2>
<p>A: We plan to support SpiderOak. We also have an "<a href="http://blog.mozilla.org/thunderbird/">Up-for-grabs</a>" project available if anybody would like to add support for more services or protocols. Also have a look at the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Mozilla/Thunderbird/Filelink_Providers">Developer documentation for the Filelink feature</a>.
</p>
<h2 id="w_q-i-dont-like-the-idea-of-storing-my-files-with-third-parties-like-this-do-regular-attachments-still-work">Q: I don''t like the idea of storing my files with third-parties like this. Do regular attachments still work?</h2>
<p>A: Regular email attachments still work the same as they always have. We''ve just given you the ability to choose to upload large attachments somewhere else, if you wish. Thunderbird''s notion of a large file defaults to 1 MB, but can be customized in Thunderbird''s Preferences:
</p>
<ol><li> Click Thunderbird app menu <span class="menu">☰</span> &gt; <span class="menu">Settings</span>.

</li><li> Select the <strong>Attachment</strong> panel and choose the <strong>Outgoing</strong> tab.
</li><li> Set the file size for the Filelink warning.
</li></ol>
<p>The offer to upload can also be disabled entirely by removing the selection from the <strong>Offer to share for files larger than</strong> option.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "154676", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "Dec 17, 2017, 8:14:37 PM", "datetime": "2017-12-17T20:14:37-08:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "TyDraniu", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/TyDraniu/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "ownCloud addon is not available.", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "Dec 22, 2017, 10:03:31 AM", "datetime": "2017-12-22T10:03:31-08:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed by", "text": "MattAuSupport", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is approved?", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Is current revision?", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "Yes", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization", "text": "Jul 7, 2018, 1:59:27 AM", "datetime": "2018-07-07T01:59:27-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Readied for localization by", "text": "Chris_Ilias", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T20:07:29+00:00','M');
