</li></ul>
<p><br>
For greater detail about cookies see the article <a href="/en-US/kb/privacy-panel-settings-in-thunderbird">Privacy panel - Remote content and cookie settings in Thunderbird</a>.
</p><p>If you still have problems, you will want to use "Get Help" to ask a question in Thunderbird support.
</p>','[{"label": "Revision id", "text": "243422", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Created", "text": "May 4, 2022, 6:03:15 AM", "datetime": "2022-05-04T06:03:15-07:00", "href": null}, {"label": "Creator", "text": "Wayne Mery", "datetime": null, "href": "https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/user/wsmwk/"}, {"label": "Comment", "text": "reverse the  order of thetwo choices. And make the steps and description more explicit", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Reviewed", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}, {"label": "Ready for localization", "text": "No", "datetime": null, "href": null}]','2026-11-03T20:04:25+00:00','');
