</li><li> You must install the newer version in the <strong>exact same</strong> installation directory name as the older version. If using the <strong>system</strong> method below, do <code>rm -rf /opt/thunderbird</code> and then install the chosen download into /opt/thunderbird/. If using the <strong>home</strong> method below, do <code>rm -rf $HOME/thunderbird</code> and then install the chosen download into $HOME/thunderbird/.
</li></ul>
