</li></ul><p></p></div>

</section>
<section class="mzp-c-details is-details">
<p></p>
<h2 id="w_thunderbird-138" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-9" aria-expanded="false">Thunderbird 138</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-9" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> Dark mode and high contrast mode improvements.
</li></ul><p></p></div>

</section>
