Calendar and address book using the EWS API will follow at a later date. Also in the future is Exchange via Graph API, so please do not file bug reports for these items at this time. 

Exchange is new, so we very much welcome your [[#feedback and bug reports]]. For more technical detail, as well as things to test and look for, see the [https://wiki.mozilla.org/Thunderbird:Exchange Thunderbird:Exchange wiki page]. {/warning}

