rbird 136</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></div>
<h1 id="w_thunderbird-150">Thunderbird 150</h1>
<ul><li> Account hub is opened on the first run of Thunderbird. It is now the default across mail, calendar and address book.
</li><li> ''Recent Destinations'' in General Settings now supports alphabetical sorting
</li><li> Custom Accent Color can be chosen in Appearance Settings.
</li></ul>
<p></p><section class="mzp-c-details is-details">
<p></p>
<h1 id="w_thunderbird-149">Thunderbird 149</h1>
<h2 id="w_exchange-improvements" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-0" aria-expanded="false">Exchange Improvements</button></h2>
<ul class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-0" aria-hidden="true"><li> Starred Exchange messages now persist across devices.
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_account-hub-on-for-address-books" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-1" aria-expanded="false">Account Hub on for Address Books</button></h2>
<ul class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-1" aria-hidden="true"><li> Address books are now created in Account Hub.
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_dark-mode-link-color-fixed" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-2" aria-expanded="false">Dark Mode link color fixed</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-2" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> Dark mode link colors are once more readable.
</li></ul><h1 id="w_thunderbird-148">Thunderbird 148</h1></div>


<h2 id="w_ntlm-support" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-3" aria-expanded="false">NTLM support</button></h2>
<ul class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-3" aria-hidden="true"><li> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NTLM">NTLM authentication</a> is now supported.
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_yahoo-aol-att-oauth2-authentication-update" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-4" aria-expanded="false">Yahoo, AOL, ATT OAuth2 authentication update</button></h2>
<ul class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-4" aria-hidden="true"><li> Thunderbird switched to a more secure authorization protocol called <strong>PKCE</strong> for Yahoo, AT&amp;T and AOL accounts. This switch adds support for Yahoo/AOL calendars and adddress books. Full details: <a href="/en-US/kb/thunderbird-and-yahoo">OAuth2 Authentication for Yahoo, AOL and ATT</a>
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_dark-mode-link-color-issue" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-5" aria-expanded="false">Dark Mode link color issue</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-5" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> Known issue: Dark mode link colors might be hard to read. Workaround: switch to a different theme. A fix has been developed for a future release; you can follow along in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2018015">bug 2018015</a>.
</li></ul><h1 id="w_thunderbird-147">Thunderbird 147</h1></div>


<h2 id="w_reset-folder-order" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-6" aria-expanded="false">Reset Folder Order</button></h2>
<ul class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-6" aria-hidden="true"><li> <span class="menu">Reset Folder Order</span> has been fixed (see the 142 section). It now restores the original location of a folder that was moved inside another parent folder.
</li></ul>
<h2 id="w_localization-of-folder-names" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-7" aria-expanded="false">Localization of folder names</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-7" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> All outstanding issues with localization of folder names have been fixed. If you notice any other issues, please <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/questions/new/thunderbird">file a Thunderbird desktop support request</a>.
</li></ul><p></p></div>

</section>
<section class="mzp-c-details is-details">
<p></p>
