<p></p>
<h2 id="w_thunderbird-8" class="is-summary"><button type="button" aria-controls="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-10" aria-expanded="false">Thunderbird 8</button></h2><div class="mzp-js-details-wrapper is-closed" id="expand-mzpcdetailshmzpcdetailsdivforh-10" aria-hidden="true"><ul><li> Refer to <a href="/en-US/kb/new-thunderbird-android-version-8">New in Thunderbird for Android version 8</a> please.
