If the {button Reply All} button is still missing after updating Thunderbird and repairing the folder, confirm that the message actually has more than one recipient in the ''''To'''' or ''''Cc'''' fields by examining the message headers with View > Message Source - ctrl+U (command+U on macOS). A message sent only to you will not show a {button Reply All} button.

