n-for-address-books"><span class="tocnumber">5.2</span> <span class="toctext">Account Hub on for Address Books</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_dark-mode-link-color-fixed"><span class="tocnumber">5.3</span> <span class="toctext">Dark Mode link color fixed</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_thunderbird-148"><span class="tocnumber">6</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 148</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_ntlm-support"><span class="tocnumber">6.1</span> <span class="toctext">NTLM support</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_yahoo-aol-att-oauth2-authentication-update"><span class="tocnumber">6.2</span> <span class="toctext">Yahoo, AOL, ATT OAuth2 authentication update</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_dark-mode-link-color-issue"><span class="tocnumber">6.3</span> <span class="toctext">Dark Mode link color issue</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_thunderbird-147"><span class="tocnumber">7</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 147</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_reset-folder-order"><span class="tocnumber">7.1</span> <span class="toctext">Reset Folder Order</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_localization-of-folder-names"><span class="tocnumber">7.2</span> <span class="toctext">Localization of folder names</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_thunderbird-146"><span class="tocnumber">8</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 146</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_drag-and-drop-on-macos"><span class="tocnumber">8.1</span> <span class="toctext">Drag and Drop on macOS</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_openpgp-keyserver"><span class="tocnumber">8.2</span> <span class="toctext">OpenPGP Keyserver</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_thunderbird-145"><span class="tocnumber">9</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 145</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"