ctext">Thunderbird 141</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_archive-action-added-to-new-email-notifications"><span class="tocnumber">17.1</span> <span class="toctext">Archive action added to new email notifications</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_better-exchange-support"><span class="tocnumber">17.2</span> <span class="toctext">Better Exchange support</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_31-day-warning-for-pgp-key-expiry"><span class="tocnumber">17.3</span> <span class="toctext">31-day warning for PGP Key expiry</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_folders-erroneously-renamed-to-junk-will-be-renamed-back-to-spam-and-bulk-in-a-post-142-release_2"><span class="tocnumber">17.4</span> <span class="toctext">Folders erroneously renamed to ‘Junk’ will be renamed back to ‘Spam’ and ‘Bulk’ in a post 142 release</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_thunderbird-140-esr-140-eclipse"><span class="tocnumber">18</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 140 / ESR 140 Eclipse</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_dark-message-mode"><span class="tocnumber">18.1</span> <span class="toctext">Dark Message Mode</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_new-appearance-panel-in-settings"><span class="tocnumber">18.2</span> <span class="toctext">New Appearance Panel in Settings</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_native-os-notifications"><span class="tocnumber">18.3</span> <span class="toctext">Native OS Notifications</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_redesigned-account-hub"><span class="tocnumber">18.4</span> <span class="toctext">Redesigned Account hub</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_manual-folder-sorting"><span class="tocnumber">18.5</span> <span class="toctext">Manual Folder Sorting</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_experimental-exchange-support-for-advanced-users"><span class="tocnumber">18.6</span> <span class="toctext">Experimental Exchange Support for advanced users</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_export-for-mobile"><span class="tocnumber">18.7</span> <span class="toctext">Export for Mobile</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_horizontal-scroll-for-table-view"><span class="tocnumber">18.8</span> <span class="toctext">Horizontal Scroll for Table View</span></a></li></ul></li><li class="toclevel-1"><a href="#w_older-releases"><span class="tocnumber">19</span> <span class="toctext">Older Releases</span></a><ul><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-139"><span class="tocnumber">19.1</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 139</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-138"><span class="tocnumber">19.2</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 138</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-137"><span class="tocnumber">19.3</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 137</span></a></li><li class="toclevel-2"><a href="#w_thunderbird-136"><span class="tocnumber">19.4</span> <span class="toctext">Thunderbird 136</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></div>
